<title>USA: Adage plans to sell two subsidiaries.</title>
<headline>Adage plans to sell two subsidiaries.</headline>
<dateline>WEST CHESTER, Penn. 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Adage Inc said it had agreements to sell two of its wholly owned subsidiaries.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal and the name of the buyer were not disclosed. The company was not immediately available for further comment.</p>
<p>Adage said it planned to sell its Allister Manufacturing Co and Fort Orange Paper Co. It said it expected the transaction to be completed within the next 30 days if the conditions of sale were met.</p>
<p>Adage makes cold drawn steel bars, recycled paper board, garage door openers and other access-control systems.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
